<body>

<div id="menu">
	<div class="wrapper">
		<ul>
			<li><a class="scroll" href="#about-me">About me</a></li>
			<li><a class="scroll" href="#services-for-you">Services for you</a></li>
			<li><a class="scroll" href="#how-to-workshops">How To workshops</a></li>
			<li><a class="scroll" href="#services-for-businesses-and-groups">Services for businesses and groups</a></li>
			<li><a class="scroll" href="#testimonials">Testimonials</a></li>
			<li><a class="scroll" href="#costs">Costs</a></li>
			<li><a class="scroll" href="#contact-me">Contact me</a></li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</div>
<div id="intro" class="section">
	<div class="wrapper">
		<h1 id="intro-logo">Talk to Shirley Counselling Psychotherapist Lifecoach in Winchester Hampshire</h1>
		<div id="intro-text">
		Hello! I'm <a class="scroll" href="#about-me">Shirley</a>. I am a counsellor, psychotherapist and life coach offering counselling, coaching and therapy
		in Winchester. Using cognitive behavioural therapy (CBT) based psychotherapeutic methodology, which is a powerful mix of life coaching, counselling and 
		psychotherapy, I can move you towards optimal mental wellbeing with an unshakable self-belief
		that will ignite your strengths, resources and creativity to get you the life you want.
		<br /><br />
		Using a blend of humour, fresh perspectives, insightfulness and creativity all wrapped up in 100%
		commitment, I can help you get to where you would like to be. Come <a class="scroll" href="#contact-me">talk to me</a>.
		</div>
		<img src="shirleypose.jpg" alt="Psychotherapist, life coach, CBT, Winchester, Talk to Shirley Gravenell" id="intro-shirley" />
	</div>
</div>
<div id="about-me" class="section">
	<div class="wrapper">
		<h2>About me</h2>
		<img src="shirleypolaroid.jpg" alt="Psychotherapist, life coach, CBT, Winchester, Talk to Shirley Gravenell" id="about-me-shirley" />
		<div id="about-me-col1">
			<span class="sectionintro">I love meeting people and have a real passion
			for helping people reach their optimum mental
			wellbeing.  I am a qualified counsellor, psychotherapist,
			psychotherapeutic coach and workshop facilitator
			with experience in supporting young people from age 16 years plus and adult mental health and
			wellbeing.</span>
			<br /><br />
			As a registered member of the British Association for Counselling
			& Psychotherapy (BACP) I work within the <a href="http://www.bacp.co.uk/ethical_framework/" target="_blank">BACP Ethical framework</a>.
			<br /><br />
			I have been told and I am an upbeat, insightful, approachable person and
			I aim to offer a service that's trustworthy, confidential and
			beneficial for you.
			<br /><br />
			I have qualifications across the spectrum of counselling, psychotherapy and life coaching. Using this knowledge and understanding plus my many years of experience I am able to empower individuals and groups with excellent results. I have worked with organisations including  Mind, Samaritans, Family Centres, Adult Continuing Education, Social Services and across the voluntary sector.
		</div>
		<div id="about-me-col2">
			<strong>My qualifications include:</strong>
			<ul>
				<li>Professional Diploma in Therapeutic Counselling Level 5</li>
				<li>Post Graduate Diploma (with Distinction) in Human Givens
			Psychotherapy</li>
				<li>Person Centred Counselling</li>
				<li>Solution Focused Practitioner</li>
				<li>Recovery Toolkit Facilitator</li>
				<li>Laughter Therapy Facilitator</li>
			</ul>
			<br />
			If any of what I can offer appeals then come and <a class="scroll" href="#contact-me">talk to me</a>.
			You have nothing to lose except how you feel right now about
	yourself and your life. Why not try out my &pound;15 taster session? Or a <a class="scroll" href="#how-to-workshops">HOWTO Workshop</a>?
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
<div id="services-for-you" class="section">
	<div class="wrapper">
		<h2>Services for you</h2>
		<div id="services-for-you-col1">
			<span class="sectionintro">We are all subjected to the challenges that
			life throws at us but few people are aware of how beneficial coaching
			or therapy sessions are. I offer a variety of services tailored to
			your individual needs.</span>
			<br /><br />
			<strong>Do any of the following statements make you want to say
			"That's me!"?</strong>
			<br /><br />
			<ul>
				<li>A relationship or job has ended and you feel like your life
					has too.</li>
				<li>You don't want to do things in case you fail and you just
					could not bear the thought of that as it means you would
					have let yourself down, let alone everyone else.</li>
				<li>Worried that one day the mask that you put on to get
					through life everyday will slip and the real you will be
					revealed.</li>
				<li>Losing or lost your sight? Or living with someone that has and
					feeling overwhelmed by emotions because of it?</li>
				<li>Children grown up, left home and you are feeling lost and
					redundant along with the empty washing basket.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<div id="services-for-you-col2">
			<ul>
				<li>Hate confrontation so always end up saying yes or doing
					what everyone else wants you to do, and your life is not your own.</li>
				<li>Been in an abusive relationship for a long time and
					managed to get out of it but it has left you feeling “broken”.</li>
				<li>Everyone else seems to get the things they want in life,
					relationships, doing work they enjoy etc so "why can't I?"</li>
				<li>Become angry, frustrated, annoyed quickly and that's on a
					good day.</li>
				<li>Retired or just about to retire and not sure what to do with
					the rest of your life - buying slippers and learning to smoke a
					pipe does not appeal.</li>
				<li>Never feel good enough, always beating yourself up over
					something. Guilt is never far away.</li>
				<li>Fear, anxiety and phobias keep you from doing what you
					want to do. No matter how hard you try to shake them off
					they always find you.</li>
				<li>You are always saying to yourself that tomorrow you'll
					eat sensibly, stop drinking or control your compulsive
					behaviours, and when tomorrow comes you say it again.</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
		<div id="services-for-you-col3">
			<ul>
				<li>You have experienced a situation which has been quite
					traumatic for you and as hard as you try not to you are
					reliving the situation over and over in your mind. This may
					cause you to have disturbed sleep, be highly anxious and an
					avoidance of everyday things that may trigger the process.</li>
				<li>You are considering going back into the job market after a
					long break. The thought of it is a daunting one.</li>
				<li>You are a relative or friend of someone who has alcohol/drug
					abuse problems and you are at your wits end.</li>
				<li>Your get up and go has got up and gone; you have no motivation to do
					anything and all the things you liked to do doesn't interest
					you anymore. Fed up with everything sums you up.</li>
			</ul>
			<span id="services-for-you-col3-highlight1">If you answered "That's me!" to any of those statements
			then why keep struggling with it any longer?</span>
			<br /><br />
			<span id="services-for-you-col3-highlight2">Come and <a class="scroll" href="#contact-me">talk to me</a>. You have nothing to lose except how you feel right now about yourself and your life. Why not try out my £15 taster session? Or a <a class="scroll" href="#how-to-workshops">How To Workshop</a>?</span>
		</div>
		<img id="services-for-you-relationshipproblems" alt="Relationship Problems, Talk to Shirley" src="services-relationship-problems.png" />
		<img id="services-for-you-angryfrustrated" alt="Angry & Frustrated, Talk to Shirley" src="services-angry-frustrated.png" />
		<img id="services-for-you-traumaticsituation" alt="Traumatic Situation, Talk to Shirley" src="services-traumatic-situation.png" />
		<img id="services-for-you-getupandgo" alt="Get Up And Go Has Gone, Talk to Shirley" src="services-get-up-and-go.png" />
		<img id="services-for-you-anxietyphobias" alt="Fear anxiety and phobias, Talk to Shirley" src="services-fear-anxiety-phobias.png" />
		<img id="services-for-you-whycanti" alt="Why Can't I? Talk to Shirley" src="services-why-cant-i.png" />
	</div>
</div>
<div id="services-for-businesses-and-groups">
	<div class="wrapper">
		<h2>Services for businesses and groups</h2>
		<div id="services-for-businesses-and-groups-col1">
			<span class="sectionintro">My group and business sessions are
			tailored to meet varying needs, from
			team building for a volunteer group to
			empowering staff to optimise their own emotional wellbeing.</span>
		</div>
		<div id="services-for-businesses-and-groups-col2">
			All my sessions are bespoke, but here is a flavour of
			what I can provide:
			<br /><br />
			<ul>
				<li>Emotional Wellbeing skills</li>
				<li>Alternative team building</li>
				<li>Basic counselling skills</li>
				<li>Life coaching</li>
				<li>Confidence and assertiveness building</li>
				<li>Psychotherapeutic coaching</li>
				<li>Laughter class/therapy</li>
			</ul>
			<span id="services-for-businesses-and-groups-col3-highlight">Come and <a class="scroll" href="#contact-me">talk to me</a>. Together we can create the
			right session for your business or group.</span>
		</div>
		<img id="services-for-businesses-and-groups-polaroid" alt="Businesses and groups, Talk to Shirley" src="services-polaroid.png" />
		<img id="services-for-businesses-and-groups-laughtertherapy" alt="Laughter Therapy, Talk to Shirley" src="services-laughter-therapy.png" />
		<img id="services-for-businesses-and-groups-alternativeteambuilding" alt="Alternative Team Building, Talk to Shirley" src="services-alternative-team-building.png" />
	</div>
</div>
<div id="how-to-workshops" class="section">
	<div class="wrapper">
		<h2>How To workshops</h2>
		<div id="how-to-workshops-col1">
			<span class="sectionintro">My range of How To Workshops have been created to suit
			either one person or a small group. They have proven very
			popular as they are delivered in a friendly, approachable,
			confidential space.</span>
			<br /><br />
			The workshops focus on building an understanding of
			key concepts and putting into practice simple useful
			skills and techniques. You can take away these tools
			right from the first session.
			<br /><br />
			<a href="https://www.facebook.com/talktoshirley/events" target="_blank">See our latest events</a>
		</div>
		<div id="how-to-workshops-col2">
			<ul>
				<li>How to improve your self-confidence</li>
				<li>How to improve your communication skills</li>
				<li>How to lift your mood quickly</li>
				<li>How to cope with anxiety (including social anxiety and panic attacks)</li>
				<li>How to recover from domestic violence physical and/or emotional</li>
				<li>How to use the knowledge and understanding of how your brain works to help with stress, anger, depression and anxiety</li>
				<li>How to use relaxation and mindfulness to cope with the stresses and strains of living</li>
				<li>How to use the power of laughter therapy to feel really good</li>
			</ul>
			<span id="how-to-workshops-col2-highlight">Come and <a class="scroll" href="#contact-me">talk to me</a> to find out more about what session/s might be suited to you.</span>
		</div>
		<img id="how-to-workshops-improve-communication-skills" alt="Improve your communication skills, Talk to Shirley" src="howto-improve-communication-skills.png" />
		<img id="how-to-workshops-lift-your-mood-quickly" alt="How to lift your mood quickly, Talk to Shirley" src="howto-lift-your-mood-quickly.png" />
	</div>
</div>
