<div id="costs" class="section">
	<div class="wrapper">
		<h2>Costs</h2>
		<div id="costs-col1">
			<strong>Taster Session</strong>
			<br />
			&pound;15 for 50 minute session
			<br />
			I want you to feel sure that I am right for you and that you feel comfortable working with me, so I offer a £15 taster session. We can discuss what is on your mind and how I can support you to make  positive changes.
			<br /><br />
			<strong>Follow On Sessions</strong>
			&pound;40 for 50 minute session.
			This includes a 10 min support phone call between sessions if needed.
			<br />
			<strong>Feel better right from the very first session!</strong>
			<br />
			6-12 weekly sessions are usually required to make changes.  However it could be shorter or longer depending on the circumstances and individual needs.
			

			<br /><br />
			All sessions can be <strong>face to face, Skype or telephone.</strong>
			<br />
			The sessions are undertaken in a private, confidential, comfortable setting in Winchester  
			or if more convenient for you Skype and telephone sessions are available at the same cost.
			<br /><br /> 
			<strong>How To Sessions</strong>
			<br />Come and <a class="scroll" href="#contact-me">talk to me</a> to find out more about what session/s might be right for you, the availability and cost.
			<br /><br />
			<strong>Student Counsellors/Psychotherapists</strong>
			<br />&pound;25 per 50 minute session. Integrative Counselling.
			<br /><br />
			All sessions are to be paid in full at least four days in advance of each session by PayPal, bank transfer or cash. If payment is not received the session will be cancelled. 
			<br />
			Any sessions cancelled  with less than 48hrs notice will be charged the full fee.
		</div>
		<img id="costs-student-counsellor-concessions" alt="Student Counsellor Concessions, Talk to Shirley" src="costs-student-counsellor-concessions.png" />
		<img id="costs-taster-sessions-available" alt="£15 Taster sessions available, Talk to Shirley" src="costs-taster-sessions-available.png" />
	</div>
</div>
